## Preserved authority boundaries

`Observed != Validated` remains unchanged.

A universal BlueStacks candidate binding proves only exact correspondence to a specialized candidate that the existing generator emitted and the current installed-build planner can represent. It does not grant measured evidence, confidence, winner status, recommendation authority, persistence permission or mutation authority beyond the existing runtime path.

The downstream authority chain remains controlled measurement → direct typed evidence → repeatability/evaluation → fingerprint/freshness → validation where applicable → ValidatedEvidence / existing winner-profile authority.
